    "difficulty": "Easy",
    "problemStatement": "Given the head of a singly linked list and an integer k, split the linked list into k consecutive parts. The sizes of the parts should differ by at most one node, and earlier parts should not be smaller than later parts. Return the heads of the k parts.",
